{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fastrak : Metro is a game where you drive trains on <i>real Australian railway lines!</i><br><br>The game will feature faithful but stylised recreations of rail lines around Australia, where\u00a0<i>you</i> can pilot suburban trains. Unlock levels with various interesting trains and timetables, or try to complete strange objectives to unlock secret levels!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Featuring 3 Suburban Lines:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Belgrave Line</strong> from Southern Cross to Ringwood</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Inner West Line</strong> from Central to Parramatta</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Fremantle Line</strong> from Perth to Fremantle</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">And plenty of Trains:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> X'trap 100</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Edi Comeng</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">HCMT</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Vlocity</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">T set</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">M set</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A set</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">K set</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A series</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">B series</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">C series</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">ADL Class</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">+more!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Gameplay:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In the game you control trains by adjusting the throttle and brakes, you must follow the speed limits, stop at stations on time, and stop as close to the marker as possible for the highest score. With your score you can unlock new levels with different stopping patterns, interesting sets, or unique environments!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game was designed for casual railway fans, so no complex starting procedures or shunting, Just get in and drive!</p>","