</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A series</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">B series</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">C series</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">ADL Class</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">+more!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Gameplay:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In the game you control trains by adjusting the throttle and brakes, you must follow the speed limits, stop at stations on time, and stop as close to the marker as possible for the highest score. With your score you can unlock new levels with different stopping patterns, interesting sets, or unique environments!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game was designed for casual railway fans, so no complex starting procedures or shunting, Just get in and drive!</p>","developers":["turbocobraInteractive"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918220/10e45b1e1f08e1bd574c3f70b9e03409d3084229/header.jpg?t=1754356616","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257175680,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257175680/movie480.mp4?t=1754356615","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257175680/movie_max.mp4?t=1754356615"},"name":"Announcement Trailer 1 Steam","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257175680/4a093e9a2da3c4ef222355f2ed904084b4601934/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1754356615","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257175680/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1754356615","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257175680/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1754356615"}}],"name":"Fastrak : Metro","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> i5 4